      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Qwen-Image 2.1 Viggle Turbo (6 steps)\n\n~20 s for 1024x1024 instead of ~66 s, close to the 40-step model; small dense text and complex edits suffer most.\n\n- The LoRA is applied at runtime by **Viggle Turbo LoRA (unmerged)**; keep it at 1.0. The stock LoRA loader would merge it into the int8 weights and add noise.\n- **Viggle Turbo Sigmas** sets the 6-step schedule for the latent's size. There is no cfg and no negative prompt.\n- Images are saved without the prompt or workflow embedded."
      ],
      "title": "Notes",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
